      "content": "It is smart to start documenting these incidents immediately to build a case. Create a detailed log entry for every strange event, noting the date, time, who was involved, and exactly what happened. Save all relevant digital communications, such as the emails regarding payroll or meeting changes, in a secure, personal folder outside of company servers. Keeping this objective record will be vital evidence if you need to pursue legal action.",
