      "content": "that makes sense. i already feel like they're watching my every move to see if i crack. it's like they're deliberately trying to create a hostile environment to trigger a burnout so they can fire me for cause. if i keep this log, should i start including my intuition about *why* they're doing it after each event? like, \"this felt like a direct attempt to destabilize me\"? i want to make sure the pattern of psychological warfare is clear in the record.",
